<title>NEW ZEALAND: New Zealand city weather forecasts for Jan 22.</title>
<headline>New Zealand city weather forecasts for Jan 22.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Forecasts for tomorrow.</p>
<p>		------ Wind ------------------ Weather ------------</p>
<p>		 speed	dir   tonight	  tomorrow	 temp</p>
<p>Auckland     sea breezes	fine	     fine		 25</p>
<p>Hamilton     light winds	fine	     fine		 28</p>
<p>Gisborne     sea breezes	fine	     fine		 28</p>
<p>Napier/Hast  sea breezes	fine	     fine		 27</p>
<p>Palmerston N fresh	NW    fine	     some high cloud  23</p>
<p>Wellington   strong     NW    fine	     some high cloud  23</p>
<p>Greymth/Hok  increasing N     some cloud     risk of drizzle  21</p>
<p>Christchurch gusty	NW    some cloud     high cloud	 29</p>
<p>Dunedin	gusty	NW    some cloud     high cloud	 25</p>
<p>Queenstown   strong     W     some rain	some rain	  22</p>
<p>Invercargill strong     W     some rain	rain		 20</p>
<p>--Wellington Newsroom (64 4) 4734746</p>
